---
// StepPilgrims.astro — Step 2: Pilgrim card upload (PilgrimCardIsland mounts here)
---

<div class="step-panel hidden" id="step-2" data-step="2">
  <div class="step-header center">
    <h1 class="step-title">Peregrinos</h1>
    <p class="step-desc" id="step2-desc">
      Completa los datos de cada peregrino — haz clic en <strong>Editar</strong> para modificar
    </p>
    <svg class="squiggle-line" viewBox="0 0 200 12" preserveAspectRatio="none">
      <path
        d="M0,6 Q25,0 50,6 T100,6 T150,6 T200,6"
        fill="none"
        stroke="#00AB39"
        stroke-width="2.5"
        stroke-linecap="round"></path>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <!-- PilgrimCardIsland mounts here — all pilgrim cards shown simultaneously in a flex grid -->
  <div
    id="pilgrim-card-slots"
    style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;justify-content:center;padding:.5rem 0"
  ></div>
</div>
